      "literal": "$$\n  H \\biggl(\\frac{1+2i}{3} \\vert 0\\rangle - \\frac{2}{3} \\vert 1\\rangle\\biggr)\n  = \\begin{pmatrix}\n    \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} & \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} \\\\[2mm]\n    \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} & -\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\n  \\end{pmatrix}\n  \\begin{pmatrix}\n    \\frac{1+2i}{3}\\\\[2mm]\n    -\\frac{2}{3}\n  \\end{pmatrix}\n  = \\begin{pmatrix}\n    \\frac{-1+2i}{3\\sqrt{2}}\\\\[2mm]\n    \\frac{3+2i}{3\\sqrt{2}}\n  \\end{pmatrix}\n  = \\frac{-1+2i}{3\\sqrt{2}} | 0 \\rangle\n  + \\frac{3+2i}{3\\sqrt{2}} | 1 \\rangle\n$$",
