      "literal": "$$\n  T \\vert {+} \\rangle\n  = T \\biggl(\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} \\vert 0\\rangle + \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} \\vert 1\\rangle\\biggr)\n  = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} T\\vert 0\\rangle + \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} T\\vert 1\\rangle\n  = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} \\vert 0\\rangle + \\frac{1+i}{2} \\vert 1\\rangle\n$$",
