      "literal": "$$\nT \\vert 0\\rangle = \\vert 0\\rangle\n\\quad\\text{and}\\quad\nT \\vert 1\\rangle = \\frac{1 + i}{\\sqrt{2}} \\vert 1\\rangle.\n$$",
